    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Silver Tongue Protocol.</strong> You have rehearsed, iterated, and field-tested the art of getting people to <em>actually</em> talk.</p><ul><li>Whenever you make a <strong>Diplomacy (Presence)</strong> or <strong>Stealth (Intrigue)</strong> check, you can treat a rolled result of 8 or lower on the 2d10x10 as a 9 instead. You can use this feature a number of times per Soma Break equal to your Presence modifier (minimum once).</li><li>In Courtly Intrigue, you can spend one use of this feature to reroll the lowest die on a single Influence roll.</li></ul><p>(The Active Effect below also gives you a small numeric edge on Diplomacy (Presence) and Stealth (Intrigue) checks as a quality-of-life bonus.)</p>",
